oops  most refugees first arrive in the  moldovan capital kisanau  so far over 200 000 refugees have fled  from ukraine to neighboring moldova its  reception centers are overcrowded per as  it is the country is taking in as many  refugees as possible ukrainians are  grateful even if most want to move on  is this any class they tend to us around  the clock  there's tea coffee bed linen  we'll head to romania first  i don't know where we'll go from there  [Music]  the people of kochiri meanwhile are  afraid their village could once again be  engulfed by war  a nightmare scenario one people here  hope can be averted
 

